ceti-tag-data-capture (2.5-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Sync package version with the application version (V2.5.1)
  * State machine: PREDEPLOY/FLOATING/LOW_POWER_BURN/SHUTDOWN states, thread
    manager, LED controller thread, low-memory detection (v2.5 line)
  * Argos recovery board integration with the libCetiRecovery protocol submodule
  * Fix burnwire timeout persistence, float detection, recovery board startup
    retries, NMEA buffer bounds, and BMS FET register handling
  * Enable float detection (FLOAT_DETECTION 1)
  * Add recovery board protocol unit tests; add reverse-engineering docs (docs/)

 --  CETI Project <cetiproject.org>  Fri, 28 Aug 2026 00:00:01 +0000

